1
00:00:00,696 --> 00:00:02,946
[PENNY VOMITS]

2
00:00:03,116 --> 00:00:06,326
PENNY:
Yep. Because I'm gonna be dead.

3
00:00:09,539 --> 00:00:11,459
(Leonard:)Hey, Sheldon?

4
00:00:11,707 --> 00:00:15,297
Listen, Penny's sick and she's not
gonna be able to go to Switzerland...

5
00:00:15,461 --> 00:00:19,591
(Leonard:)...so if you're still interested,
you're welcome to come.

6
00:00:19,757 --> 00:00:22,427
[VOMITING THEN COUGHING]

7
00:00:23,719 --> 00:00:25,389
[TOILET FLUSHES]

8
00:00:27,557 --> 00:00:29,767
(Sheldon:)Great. I'll start packing.

9
00:00:31,644 --> 00:00:33,604
(Sheldon:)In a minute.

10
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:37,359
[SHELDON VOMITING]

11
00:00:37,775 --> 00:00:40,905
(Sheldon:)Oh, look, it's the cholermus.

12
00:00:47,243 --> 00:00:49,913
[COUGHING THEN BLOWS NOSE]

13
00:00:51,539 --> 00:00:54,209
Ugh. Here's your soup.

14
00:00:54,375 --> 00:00:55,835
(Sheldon:)-Chicken?
-Yes.

15
00:00:56,002 --> 00:00:57,752
(Sheldon:)-With the little stars?
-Yes.

16
00:00:57,962 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)Heated to 180 degrees?

